  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759369,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 12-Sai - Honto no Kimochi: A Nintendo 3DS Romance Adventure\n\nDive into the heartwarming world of *12-Sai - Honto no Kimochi*, a charming Nintendo 3DS romance adventure game based on the beloved manga and anime, *Age 12*.  Step into the shoes of a young girl navigating the complexities of first love and friendship in a quaint seaside town.  \n\nThe story revolves around your character’s budding feelings for a boy named Kōhei, a kind and gentle soul who’s recently moved in.  As you spend time with him and his younger sister, Hotaru, you’ll uncover family secrets and navigate the challenges of growing up.  \n\nGameplay focuses on building relationships through dialogue choices and actions.  Carefully select your responses to deepen your connection with Kōhei and other characters, influencing the story's progression and ultimately determining the ending you receive.  Mini-games and exploration add further depth to the experience.  Experience a touching tale of innocence, discovery, and the true meaning of heartfelt emotions, all beautifully presented on your Nintendo 3DS."
    },
